{"track":"sql","category":"조인","level":2,"title":"영화와 감독 이름","datasets":["movies","directors"],"desc":"<p>모든 영화의 제목과 감독 이름을 조회하세요. (<code>movies.director_id</code> ↔ <code>directors.director_id</code>)</p><p>열: <code>title</code>, <code>director</code></p>","starter":"-- 여기에 쿼리를 작성하세요\n","ordered":false,"solution":"SELECT m.title, d.name AS director\nFROM movies m\nJOIN directors d ON m.director_id = d.director_id;","hint":"<p><code>JOIN 표 ON 연결 조건</code> 으로 두 표를 이어요.</p>","id":"sql-058","expected":{"columns":["title","director"],"rows":[["Silent Orchard","Han Seojun"],["The Last Garden","Han Seojun"],["Midnight Train","Han Seojun"],["Hollow Signal","Mina Park"],["Quantum Drift","Mina Park"],["Space Harvest","Mina Park"],["Sunday Brunch","Luca Romano"],["Double Booked","Luca Romano"],["Laugh Track","Luca Romano"],["Little Comets","Aiko Tanaka"],["Paper Moon City","Aiko Tanaka"],["Steel Rain","Chen Wei"],["Edge of Dawn","Chen Wei"],["Iron Harbor","Chen Wei"]]}}